OL,3,GNEWSAFather who died after being hit by
OL,4,Acar is named
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes are being paid to a man who
OL,7,Fwas killed after being hit by a car in
OL,8,FFolkestone.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,FCanterbury Road at 18:39 GMT on Sunday
OL,12,Fto reports that a pedestrian had been
OL,13,Fstruck by a black VW Sharan.
OL,15,FAndy Gardiner, 59, was confirmed dead
OL,16,Fat the scene.
OL,18,FHis family said in a statement: "Andy
OL,19,Fwas an amazing father, grandfather,
OL,20,Fbrother, partner, friend. Tragically
OL,21,Ftaken too soon from all who knew and
OL,22,Floved him."
